{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>【Now新聞台】筲箕灣有水管爆裂。</p>\n<p>水不斷從地底的水管湧出，附近餐廳的雜物被沖倒，商戶加緊清理積水，並用發泡膠箱擋水，車輛要涉水而行。</p>\n<p>事發在早上10時許，筲箕灣道318號對出，路政署路邊工地旁邊地底有水管爆裂。一間院舍的玻璃窗懷疑被水沖破，碎片濺傷一名女院友，由救護車送往東區醫院治理。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-27T04:22:03.552201+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":144,"images":0,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-27T04:14:27+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T04:38:18.906928+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-27T04:18:36.777849+00:00","content_hash":"7abbac3b5e485a816fde67a6640ef9d8625fd01fde768e1ad3b9117f14dae3ff","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-27T04:22:03.552201+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}